Rules:

Weight before size for hierarchy (Medium for controls, SemiBold for headings, Bold for hero only)
Negative tracking on headings (−0.28px at 14px → −1.44px at 36px)
Positive tracking on overlines (+1.2px, always uppercase)
Body line-height: ~1.45. Heading line-height: ~1.15–1.3